    {
      "id": "WI-0053",
      "title": "Fix ./ros hitting an unhandled 404 for a main-branch snapshot rosVersion",
      "description": "A project bootstrapped via the documented @main install flow gets a ros.json rosVersion like 2.0.1-main.78.1; publish.yml never builds/publishes a binary for snapshot versions, so the launcher's blind download attempt surfaced a raw 404 instead of a clear error.",
