      "source": "manual",
      "sourceReference": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WI-0054",
      "title": "Fix ros-bootstrap init pinning a scaffolded project to a binary-less @main snapshot version",
      "description": "Bootstrapping via the documented @main install flow writes a ros.json rosVersion (e.g. 2.0.1-main.78.1) that never has a matching GitHub Release, so ./ros can never run -- the earlier launcher fix (WI-0053) only made the failure message clearer. Fixed by pinning ros.json to the newest stable release with real binaries instead, via a version bundled into the npm tarball at publish time (DF-ROS-2026-A034).",
      "tags": [],
      "priority": "high",
      "status": "ready",
      "attachments": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-09-11T13:23:10.444Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-11T13:23:13.000Z",
